  "details": "Issue Summary:\n\nWhen I open or drop a portal to an instance, there is a chance that the portal does not render or appear visible on my end, even though the portal is successfully spawned and other players in the instance can see/interact with it normally.\n\nThis issue occurs intermittently in both Desktop mode and VR mode.\n\nFrequency:\n\nIntermittent (occurs occasionally).\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\nJoin an instance (in either Desktop or VR mode).\n\nOpen the menu and select a world/instance to drop a portal.\n\nConfirm portal placement.\n\nObserved Result: The portal spawns and is usable by others, but it remains completely invisible on my screen.\n\nExpected Result: The portal should be visible to me immediately after being placed.\n\nAdditional Details & Evidence:\n\nI have recorded a video showing this behavior: https://youtu.be/ie1gKYYDdzc\n\nPlatform: PC (Reproducible in both Desktop mode and PCVR)\n\nThank you for your time and help looking into this!",
